OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FThe SDLP will use an Opposition day    
OL,7,Fdebate at Stormont today (Monday) to   
OL,8,Fcall on BBC Northern Ireland to give   
OL,9,Fthe public more clarity and            
OL,10,Faccountability over its cuts to local  
OL,11,Fservices.                              
OL,13,FThe party plans to highlight public    
OL,14,Fconcern about the removal of in-house  
OL,15,FIrish language services, the closure of
OL,16,Fin-house factual programming and the   
OL,17,Fcancellation of local comedy           
OL,18,Fprogrammes.                            
OL,20,FIt will also raise the recently        
OL,21,Fannounced cuts to factual programming  
OL,22,Fat UTV.                                
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
