OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FThe move comes days after Clean Feed   
OL,7,Fchallenged Northern Ireland's          
OL,8,Fpoliticians to act on the cuts at both 
OL,9,FBBC Northern Ireland and UTV.          
OL,11,FOpposition Leader Matthew O'Toole MLA  
OL,12,Fsaid: "Public service broadcasting     
OL,13,Fmatters, and we want a healthy BBC.    
OL,14,FPublic service media matters enormously
OL,15,Fat a time of misinformation, online    
OL,16,Fextremism and technological disruption.
OL,18,F"But public service media has to be    
OL,19,Faccountable to the public it serves,   
OL,20,Fand which pays for it."                
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,146,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14503
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FHe said BBC Northern Ireland was making
OL,7,F"swinging cuts" to the services people 
OL,8,Fwant "without any public clarity or    
OL,9,Faccountability on what is going on,"   
OL,10,Fadding: "When we are legally obliged to
OL,11,Fpay for these services, that isn't good
OL,12,Fenough."                               
OL,14,FThe SDLP also criticised what it       
OL,15,Fdescribed as the resources given to "a 
OL,16,Fnarrow section of hardline voices" on  
OL,17,FBBC radio, pointing to coverage of the 
OL,18,Frecent Drumcree debate.                
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
