OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FBBC Northern Ireland needs to save     
OL,7,Faround #4.1 million by the end of      
OL,8,F2027/28, as part of #500m in savings   
OL,9,Facross the BBC.                        
OL,11,FThree of the five full-time posts in   
OL,12,Fits Irish language unit are going, and 
OL,13,Fcampaigners say live Radio Ulster Irish
OL,14,Flanguage programmes such as Blas will  
OL,15,Fmost likely end.                       
OL,17,FBBC Northern Ireland has said the plans
OL,18,Fchange how Irish language content is   
OL,19,Fmade rather than reduce spending on the
OL,20,Flanguage.                              
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,146,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14505
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FThe restructuring also includes the    
OL,7,Fclosure of BBC NI's in-house Factual   
OL,8,Fdepartment, with core production       
OL,9,Fcapacity kept for major events. On the 
OL,10,Fcomedy side, Give My Head Peace and The
OL,11,FBlame Game will not return, and the    
OL,12,Fradio show A Perforated Ulster has also
OL,13,Fbeen axed.                             
OL,15,FThe cuts are not limited to Northern   
OL,16,FIreland. The BBC plans to cut between  
OL,17,F1,800 and 2,000 jobs, and in June it   
OL,18,Fset out #9m of cuts affecting around 50
OL,19,Froles in Wales, and over #10m of       
OL,20,Fsavings and up to 60 roles affected in 
OL,21,FScotland.                              
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,146,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14506
SC,0006
