CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FIn October it confirmed that BBC       
OL,7,FScotland (TV channel), BBC Three and   
OL,8,FBBC Radio 4 Extra would all stop linear
OL,9,Fbroadcasting in spring 2027.           
OL,11,FAt UTV, four production jobs are at    
OL,12,Frisk and the current affairs series Up 
OL,13,FClose is being dropped, along with     
OL,14,FHidden NI, Life Times, True NI and     
OL,15,Fone-off specials.                      
OL,17,FUTV Life and View from Stormont are    
OL,18,Fbeing kept, and a cheaper studio-based 
OL,19,Fprogramme, working title The UTV Show, 
OL,20,Fwill run twice a week.                 
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
