OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FITV Wales plans to end the rural       
OL,7,Faffairs series Coast and Country and   
OL,8,Fthe arts show Backstage, with the      
OL,9,Fnumber of producers there possibly     
OL,10,Ffalling from six to two.               
OL,12,FITV is making 17 redundancies across   
OL,13,Fthe UK as it prepares to sell its      
OL,14,Fchannels and ITV X to Sky for #1.6bn,  
OL,15,Fwith Sky targeting #200m in cost       
OL,16,Fsavings.                               
OL,18,FUTV reported its first annual operating
OL,19,Floss in a decade, of #1.4m, in         
OL,20,FSeptember.                             
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
