OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/8 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCSDLP to raise BBC Northern Ireland
OL,4,Cand UTV cuts in Stormont debate        
OL,6,FBroadcasting is a reserved matter      
OL,7,Fdecided at Westminster, so the Northern
OL,8,FIreland Assembly has no direct power   
OL,9,Fover the BBC, ITV or Ofcom.            
OL,11,FBut today's debate puts the cuts on the
OL,12,Fpolitical record at Stormont, following
OL,13,Fearlier calls from SDLP MLA Patsy      
OL,14,FMcGlone, who sought urgent talks with  
OL,15,FBBC NI leadership in October over the  
OL,16,FIrish language job losses.             
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
